1
00:00:00,171 --> 00:00:02,141
I think he's onto us!

2
00:00:08,646 --> 00:00:10,136
(Penny:)Okay. Glasses off.

3
00:00:10,782 --> 00:00:12,772
(Penny:)Find Waldo.

4
00:00:18,156 --> 00:00:19,746
(Sheldon:)Hurry up, find him. Find him.

5
00:00:19,958 --> 00:00:22,688
- I'm trying! Don't yell at me!
- For goodness' sake.

6
00:00:22,894 --> 00:00:25,384
(Sheldon:)He's wearing a hat,
glasses and a red-striped shirt!

7
00:00:25,563 --> 00:00:28,053
- I know what he looks like!
- There he is, I got him!

8
00:00:28,266 --> 00:00:30,756
Yes! We win again. Yes.

9
00:00:30,969 --> 00:00:32,599
(Sheldon:)How could you not find him?

10
00:00:32,804 --> 00:00:35,234
Because he's hard to find!

11
00:00:35,406 --> 00:00:39,066
(Leonard:)If he was easy to find,
the books would be called There's Waldo!

12
00:00:41,312 --> 00:00:44,472
Fifty-seven, 58, 59.

13
00:00:44,682 --> 00:00:46,552
(Leonard:)That's one minute.

14
00:00:49,287 --> 00:00:52,447
(Amy:)Long division, long division. Go, go, go.

15
00:00:52,624 --> 00:00:54,554
(Leonard:)Remember, show your work.

16
00:00:56,561 --> 00:01:03,021
(Sheldon:)I'm okay. I'm okay.

